18BB6: "Xe aancint lejindz saa xat ships frum xe Sekund Yuunyun wuns fild ar skiis and wil wun daa kum agen. Madern siientists, huu wuns dismist suc lejindz and felt xat liif eevolvd heer on Resida, now feel xat ar planit wuz reelee setuld bii men uv xe Sekund Yuunyun."

18C62: "Wexur oor not xe lejindz uv xe Sekund Yuunyun ar truu, arkeeoloojists ar surtin xat aa peereeid uv hii teknoolojikul and sooshul deevelupmint egzistid xowzindz uv yeerz agoo, but foor sum reezin sivilizaashun slid intuu aa dark aaj lasteeng senshureez."

18D0A: "Wixin xe last fiiv senshureez, xe riiz uv xe Nuu Teknakrasee haz reeturnd sivilizaashun tuu xe levul ataand beefoor xe Hiiaatus. Sooshul histooreeunz xink xat wen xe Dizeez struk, ar raas had aceevd aa levul uv sufistikaashun eekwal tuu xe pree-Hiiaatus."

18DB8: "Menee volyuumz on xe deevelupmint uv Residan lituracur ar on fiil in xe liibreree. Alsoo, kopeez uv awl graat wurks uv riiteeng, sum daateeng bak tuu xe mixikul daaz uv xe Sekund Yuunyun, ar lookaatid heer."

18E46: "Histoorikul studeez and reeproodukshunz uv Residan art ar avaalibul heer foor awl xree maajur peereeids uv art deevelupmint: xe Primitiv peereeid, xe Renasans peereeid uv xe urlee poost-Hiiaatus, and xe moost reesint peereeid uv videeoo and laazur art."

18EF2: "Reekoordeengz uv awl impoortint kompoozishunz uv xe last fiiv hundrid yeerz ar lookaatid in xe liibrereez data banks."

18F44: "Awl maajur dizeezuz hav bin kyuuribul foor oovur aa senshuree. Xe deevelupmint uv kriioojeniks now alowz dokturz tuu put paashints in staasis until aa kyuur iz fownd. Avurij Residan liif ekspektinsee iz now 147 revooluushunz."

18FDC: "Durt farmeeng iz awl but obsooleet, wix moost fuud kumeeng frum xe hiidrooponiks kompleksiz oor xe undurwatur aljee farmz."

19030: "Planateree travul iz noormulee priivit skuutur foor shoort hops, and aarbus foor longur trips. Spaas travul haz reesintlee bin revooluushuniizd bii xe invenshun uv nuukleeur-fyuuld enjinz."

190B0: "Untoold senshureez agoo, entiir teemz uv roobots wur reekwiird tuu purfoorm eevin xe simplist tasks...wun roobot wud handul viszuuwul funkshunz, wun roobot wud handul awditooree funkshunz, and soo foorx. Now, xanks tuu advansis in mineeatshurizaashun, xeez tasks kan bee purfoormd bii singul roobots, suc az xe multiipurpis B-19 seereez."

19196: "Xe priimeree Planateree Sistumz ar Kors Kuntrool (foor maantaaneeng an iideel kliimit), Deefens (foor destroieeng pootenshulee daanjuris meeteeoorz), and xe reesintlee adid Prajekt Kuntrool (foor monitureeng proogres uv Xe Prajekt)."

1923E: "Sins xe staabulizaashun uv xe oorbit uv Resida, preesiislee 47.79 pursent uv xe planits surfis iz land. Xe land iz diviidid intuu tuu priimeree landmasiz, Andoor and Fruulik, plus siks lesur landmasiz. Xe gloobul kapitul, Pilandoor, iz on xe eesturn koost uv Andoor."

192F6: "Xe furst undursee habutats wur oopind in 2992, and tuudaa, neerlee tuu senshureez laatur, abowt 9 pursent uv Residaz popyuulaashun livz in wun uv xe twentee sprawleeng undursee siteez."

19374: "Alxoo setulmints hav bin establisht on Fristin, and on sevrul uv xe muunz uv xe gas jiiunt Blustin, xe vast majooritee uv of-woorldurz liv in xe spaas kolooneez establisht at Residaz troojin points."

193FA: "Xe oorijin uv Xe Dizeez haz bin linkt tuu xe Sentur foor Advanst Kriioojenik Reesurc, wic wuz kondukteeng reesurc intuu waaz uv ekstendeeng xe Kriioojenik peereeid indefinitlee. Alxoo xis reesurc wuz aa sukses, sumhow Xe Dizeez wuz reeleest and beegan spredeeng."

194B0: "Xe tuu kompleksiz wur establisht on xe twin peek platooz uv Kalamontee and Lawanda. Xeez lookaashunz wur coozin beekawz xaar hiit wud maak transpoortaashun and komyuunikaashunz eezeeur, and soo xat xe vast reeakturz and kriioojeniks caamburz kud bee kunstruktid in xe mowntinz beeloo."

1956A: "Faaz Wun: xe kunstrukshun uv xe Kalamontee and Lawanda Kompleksiz. Faaz Tuu: mass kriioojenik freezeeng uv Residan popyuulaashun. Faaz Xree: siimultaaneeus monitureeng uv kriioojeniks wiil awtoomaatid reesurc iz konduktid bii inkrediblee soofistikaatid kumpyuuturiizd fasiliteez. Faaz Foor: reeviivul and inokyuulaashun uv xe popyuulaashun."

19658: "Xe Zoork triloojee, an adventshur klasik, taaks plaas in aa deeliitful but daanjuris undurgrownd seteeng."

196A0: "Dedliin iz xe furst graat misturee uv xe kumpyuutur aaj, and Witnis iz its wurxee suksesur."

